## Create Room

Creates a room and enters it as the host. Returns the room code.

| Option             | Type              | Default | Description                                                                                                                                                                |
| ------------------ | ----------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `maxPlayers`       | number            | `4`     | Room size, from 2 to 16 players.                                                                                                                                           |
| `isVisible`        | boolean           | `false` | Visible rooms take part in quick match and the room list.                                                                                                                  |
| `isOpen`           | boolean           | `true`  | Closed rooms do not accept new players.                                                                                                                                    |
| `filter`           | flat object       | —       | Matchmaking key, up to 16 values; see [Filter and properties](#how-it-works). A visible room is found by quick match and the filtered room list only with the same filter. |
| `properties`       | flat object       | —       | Room properties.                                                                                                                                                           |
| `playerProperties` | flat object       | —       | Properties of the local player.                                                                                                                                            |
| `syncState`        | boolean or object | —       | `true` or `{ updatesPerSecond }`: synchronizes the game world, see [Sync State](#sync-state).                                                                              |

{% tabs %}
{% tab title="Plain JS" %}

```javascript
bridge.multiplayer.createRoom({
    maxPlayers: 2,
    properties: { map: 'forest' },
})
    .then(roomId => {
        // show roomId to the player, friends join with it
    })
    .catch(error => {
        console.log(error.code) // MULTIPLAYER_CONNECTION_FAILED...
    })
```

{% endtab %}

