## Invite To Room

Asks the platform to share a link to the current room; a player who opens it gets the room code in [`launchRoomId`](#launch-room-id). Check `isInviteSupported` first; where it is `false`, show the room code instead. Options: `text`, `image`.

{% tabs %}
