Add the world with `Add Action Parameter`, then call `Multiplayer Set Sync State`; each call replaces the whole world, so add every key each time. Handle `On Multiplayer Sync State Received` and read `MultiplayerSyncStateValue("score")`: it returns the last world set or received, on the host too.
